=== 6c. correction: actual suite/test-case symbol names in vmlinux ===
The suite struct is emitted as `proxy_kunit_suite` (data) and the case as
`proxy_kunit_lifecycle` (text); there is no symbol literally named
`proxy_consumer_kunit_test_suite`, so the earlier count of 0 for that name
is a wrong-name lookup, not a missing suite.
000000006029b860 t proxy_kunit_lifecycle
00000000604b7f20 d proxy_kunit_suite
00000000604b8180 d proxy_kunit_cases
SUITE_SYMBOL_PROXY_KUNIT_SUITE=1
CASE_SYMBOL_PROXY_KUNIT_LIFECYCLE=1
Both are present in the vmlinux image that produced the TAP output, i.e. built-in.

